stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ready
    Ready: Tour notes visible
    Reading: Tour notes visible during refresh
    Editing: New notes remain in the editor
    Saved: New notes saved and visible
    Ready --> Reading: Focus notes starts background read
    Reading --> Editing: Type before read finishes
    Editing --> Editing: Read finishes without replacing local notes
    Editing --> Saved: Save now confirms the typed notes
    Reading --> Ready: Read finishes before typing
    Ready --> Editing: Type notes
    %% never: A background read hides the note editor and loses native typing.
    %% never: A completed background read replaces notes typed while it was pending.
